  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Territorialization of Public Policy for Victims of Armed Conflict for the Construction of Total and Integral Peace, Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide technical assistance to the Victim Policy Articulation Group (GAPV) of the Ministry of Interior (GOC) with the aim of improving the performance of local administrations in the implementation of the Victim Public Policy (PPV) and the Peace Agreement (AP). This objective will be achieved by implementing the Institutional Strengthening Model of Territorial Entities, enhancing the technical, administrative, coordination, and management capacities of local administrations and actors involved in the construction and implementation of the PPV at the local level, such as municipal committees and victim organizations (OV). This will contribute to overcoming vulnerability and consolidating peace in the targeted territories.</narrative>
  </description>
